{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33192","headline":"涂中寄薛中裕 · 司马扎","name":"涂中寄薛中裕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贫交千里外，失路更伤离。\n晓泪芳草尽，夜魂明月知。\n空山连野外，寒鸟下霜枝。\n此景正寥落，爲君玄髪衰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马扎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}